  "name": null,
  "problem": "",
  "worked_solution": "A table showing the metric units of mass is given below.\n\n| Name | Symbol | Conversion |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Kilogram | $\\text{kg}$ | $1\\,\\text{kg}=1\\,000\\,\\text{g}$ |\n| Gram | $\\text{g}$ | Base Unit |\n| Milligram | $\\text{mg}$ | $1\\,000\\,\\text{mg}=1\\,\\text{g}$ |\n\nSo, $1\\,\\text{kg}$ is equivalent to $1\\,000\\,\\text{g}.$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
